                        "review": "The Devs will probably never read this but this has gone from a great game to a data mining sham. \n18th October 2026 - I started the game this morning and was forced to accept two EULAs before I could play my game. I don't want them  digging through my PC for any scrap of MY data that they think they can sell, so this game is now dead to me. I will be uninstalling it after this review.\n\nShame that all good things must come to an end and in such an ignoble manner!",
